      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tullahassee%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Creek citizens gave the school and community of Tullahassee to the freedmen in 1881.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
