      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tullahassee%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Tullahassee Town Site Company recruited black residents from across the post-Reconstruction South to develop the town.",
